Z||000003||1FieroGTRacingInc||04-02-2000||12:40 AM||||Well, I know that i would still have a truck load($) to finish(kit,suspen.,etc.) my 87GT. This guy said that since I come in there often(3-4)times a week, that ,and get this,  What he said next was  such a shock to me that i almost DIED.....  " Hey Steve(me), If you would like to have that Northstar,and I(him) would really like to see it in your Fiero.... You could pay it out and when you have paid half, you can take the motor."<P>He then said" Just give me(him)$100.00 and pay me when you can and I'll hold it for you"<P>SOOOO  COOL, SOOO NICE....<P>He is really repitable.. been in same location for 35 year's.... big operation...<P>I think that I'm going to go ahead and do it(give him the $100.00) and start my lil' payment's on it...  AND  for some strange reason I decide I DON'T WANT IT... Dont hold you all's breath though...lol  I still would have it for a forim member... almostt too good to pass up...  IN THE END... IT WILL STILL MAKE ME OR SOME OTHER FORUM MEMBER A FAST FIERO DRIVER..  HEHE..  1FGTRInc.||||reg||1
Z||000004||1FieroGTRacingInc||04-02-2000||01:03 AM||||Listen Guy's... since I am going to get it, even if for nothing but the long term investment of it... but IT WILL END UP in a Fire Breathing,Mustang Eating, Rice Buring Fiero....  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif">.    I want everybody's in put on this as this is for one of our beloved Fiero's....<P>For those that want to e~mail me privatly(?) feel free to do so..   Fiero_87GT@Yahoo.com<BR>          Thank's for letting me ramble.... Just EXCITED I guess...lol..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>                      Steve<BR>                      1FieroGTRacingInc.||||reg||1
Z||000005||Dan86gt3.8||04-02-2000||04:32 AM||||Hell yes get it!!!!!!!!!!!!  I paid 1500 for a 3.8 with all the stuff!!!!!!  and had twice the miles!!!!!!!!!!  BUt do be sure to get the uncut wiring harness, tranny, and computer!  I would love to do a northstar, but I am just a poor college kid!!!!!!!!||||reg||14
Z||000006||RFMike||04-02-2000||09:33 AM||||The price is very good, if you can get everthing you need for the swap included.<P>Be very careful here.  I have known some boneyard operators that were very shady.  And even if this guy is on the up and up, get receipts for everthing you pay him.  It is not unlikely that he may "forget" about your deal in 6 months or a year.<P>Mike||||reg||1
