Z||000010||Dan86gt3.8||04-04-2000||03:06 AM||||Man I am extremely jealous!!!!!!!  i WANT A NORTH STAR BAD!   nothing wrong with a 12 second fiero!!!!!!!!!!  man You could clean up on some unsuspecting rodders!!!!!!!!  The time this prick wanted to race me in a c5 and was talking about only racing for $1000 I wiosh I had a star at the time.  But he has got it before, I don't know why he doesent learn.  He put 50 down one time on a race against a heavily modded 96 camaro that clicks off 12.4's all day long!  The camaro put like 8 links on it was awesome, but its people like him that would be great to have a northstar in your car.  Anywyas how long do you think you will be paying on it?  What is the eta for it to be in your garage?  Anyways keep us in touch!!!!!!  ||||reg||14
Z||000011||1FieroGTRacingInc||04-04-2000||09:36 PM||||Thank's for all the replies.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Well.. I think that it's out of a 97?? Fleetwood.. Does that *Fleetwood* sound right??  <P>As Far as the *payment* paying him off the other $1,500.00.  WILL  take some time... I'm a single Dad, I have a 4 yr old.. Ciara Nilcole   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">... I'm also a sub-contractor.. I install floor's *ceramic tile, hard wood, carpet.. etc..   SOOOooo  when the job's are slow coming , thing's *$* can get tight. you all know where I'm coming from..   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> I'm being really patient on this.. The Northstar WILL BE THERE... AND I CAN SAY THAT I DOOO OWN A 1987 Pontiac Fiero GT Northstar..<P> Is there such thing as a Northstar-Turbo???<P>      Thank's for the replies. 1FGTRInc.||||reg||1
Z||000012||lowCG||04-04-2000||11:18 PM||||As I'm sure you know,the very best things don't happen overnight anyways.<BR>The swap gets better with a little time to sort out the details,and figure out more ways to save $ all the same.The kits,and other's methods aren't always the most cheap,functional,and simple with my 3.4TDC swap I'm finding,and it's getting cheaper,and simpler all the time with a little thought,research,and common sense.<BR>Try and find out all the parts needed and make a list so you know what to grab when it comes around for less $.||||reg||1
