Z||000017||olympic||04-06-2000||01:43 PM||||     There are only 2 North star models. The 4.6l Cadillac and the 4.0l Oldsmobile Aurora.<BR>That 4.5l is probably a 16 valve engine with waaaaayy less power than a 32 valve 4.6l N*.<P>    Anyways,  I think all Caddy N* engines say so right on the top engine cover.  Big letters that say "32 VALVE NORTHSTAR"  Can't miss that. <P>     Here's a pic.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/nstar7.jpg"> <p>[This message has been edited by olympic (edited 04-06-2000).]||||reg||4
